name kdpcover
category Package
revision 63800
shortdesc Covers for books published by Kindle Direct Publishing
longdesc The problem this class solves is the necessity to change the
longdesc size of the cover PDF according to the number of pages in the
longdesc book -- the bigger the book, the larger the spine of the book
longdesc must be. The provided class makes the necessary calculations
longdesc on-the-fly, using the qpdf tool. Obviously, you need to have it
longdesc installed. Also, you must run pdflatex with the --shell-escape
longdesc option, in order to allow LaTeX to run qpdf.
depend anyfontsize
depend geometry
depend graphics
depend microtype
depend pgf
depend setspace
depend textpos
depend tools
depend xcolor
depend xifthen
depend xkeyval
